From fa38a7ee9125ad3eaffe6bfaaeba135c10cbc461 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:21:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Style: -webkit-backdrop-filter before backdrop-filter, so the
 minifier keeps the blur Chrome reads (dark pop-ups were see-through) (finding
 H4-9)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVyxNm2Fwb8M6A8TiczcwA
---
